@startsalt pickup-driving-licence
{+
    <b>CAR RENTAL | Agency employee
    --
    <b>Pick up car - Driving licence
    RES-001 - Alex Martin - AB-123-CD
    .
    {^"Check the original document"
        [X] Customer identity matches the driving licence
        [X] Driving licence is valid for the allocated car
    }
    .
