        [Replace scan]
    }
    .
    Save the scan before proceeding to the joint car inspection.
    If the licence is invalid or the scan fails, do not continue.
    --
    [ [[latex://fig:lofi-ui-car-allocation Back]] ] | [ [[latex://fig:lofi-ui-inspection Save scan and continue]] ]
}
